<title>USA: ALZA, SmithKline in Asia deal.</title>
<headline>ALZA, SmithKline in Asia deal.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ALZA Corp and SmithKline Beecham Plc said they entered into an agreement giving SmithKline the right to commercialize te ALZA Nicoderm product in China and Japan.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement SmithKline will make upfront milestone payments to Alza and Alza will manufacture and sell it to SmithKline.</p>
<p>Nicoderm is a skin patch designed to help people quit smoking.</p>
</text>
